<li><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Nomination_and_confirmation_to_the_Supreme_Court_of_the_United_States" title="Nomination and confirmation to the Supreme Court of the United States">Nomination and confirmation</a>
<ul><li><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Senate_Judiciary_Committee_reviews_of_nominations_to_the_Supreme_Court_of_the_United_States" title="Senate Judiciary Committee reviews of nominations to the Supreme Court of the United States">Judiciary Committee review</a></li></ul></li>
<li><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Demographics_of_the_Supreme_Court_of_the_United_States" title="Demographics of the Supreme Court of the United States">Demographics</a></li>
<li><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ideological_leanings_of_United_States_Supreme_Court_justices" title="Ideological leanings of United States Supreme Court justices">Ideological leanings of justices</a></li></ul>

<ul><li><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lists_of_United_States_Supreme_Court_cases" title="Lists of United States Supreme Court cases">Lists of decisions</a></li>
