</tr><tr><th class="sidebar-heading">
Current membership</th></tr><tr><td class="sidebar-content hlist">
<dl><dt><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Chief_Justice_of_the_United_States" title="Chief Justice of the United States">Chief Justice</a></dt></dl>
