<dl><dt><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Associate_Justice_of_the_Supreme_Court_of_the_United_States" title="Associate Justice of the Supreme Court of the United States">Associate justices</a></dt></dl>
<ul><li><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Clarence_Thomas" title="Clarence Thomas">Clarence Thomas</a></li>
<li><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Samuel_Alito" title="Samuel Alito">Samuel Alito</a></li>
<li><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sonia_Sotomayor" title="Sonia Sotomayor">Sonia Sotomayor</a></li>
<li><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Elena_Kagan" title="Elena Kagan">Elena Kagan</a></li>
