<dl><dt><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Supreme_Court_of_the_United_States#Retired_justices" title="Supreme Court of the United States">Retired justices</a></dt></dl>
<ul><li><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Anthony_Kennedy" title="Anthony Kennedy">Anthony Kennedy</a></li>
<li><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Stephen_Breyer" title="Stephen Breyer">Stephen Breyer</a></li></ul></td>
</tr><tr><th class="sidebar-heading">
Lists of justices</th></tr><tr><td class="sidebar-content hlist">
