<td id="mwng"><span typeof="mw:File" id="mwnw"><a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:John_Jay_(Gilbert_Stuart_portrait).jpg" class="mw-file-description" id="mwoA"><img resource="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:John_Jay_(Gilbert_Stuart_portrait).jpg" src="//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/72/John_Jay_%28Gilbert_Stuart_portrait%29.jpg/120px-John_Jay_%28Gilbert_Stuart_portrait%29.jpg" decoding="async" data-file-width="2322" data-file-height="3004" data-file-type="bitmap" height="129" width="100" srcset="//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/72/John_Jay_%28Gilbert_Stuart_portrait%29.jpg/250px-John_Jay_%28Gilbert_Stuart_portrait%29.jpg 2x" class="mw-file-element" id="mwoQ"/></a></span></td>
