Aw"><bdi id="mwEA0">978-1452292298</bdi></a>.</cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Abook&amp;rft.genre=book&amp;rft.btitle=Landmark+Legislation+1774%E2%80%932012%3A+Major+U.S.+Acts+and+Treaties&amp;rft.pages=122&amp;rft.pub=CQ+Press&amp;rft.date=2014&amp;rft.isbn=978-1452292298&amp;rft.aulast=Stathis&amp;rft.aufirst=Stephen+W.&amp;rft_id=https%3A%2F%2Fbooks.google.com%2Fbooks%3Fid%3DCkR1AwAAQBAJ%26pg%3DPA122&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3AList+of+justices+of+the+Supreme+Court+of+the+United+States" class="Z3988" about="#mwt14" id="mwEA4"></span></span></li>
<li about="#cite_note-2" id="cite_note-2" data-mw-footnote-number="2"><span class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwEA8"><a href="#cite_ref-2" rel="mw:referencedBy" id="mwEBA"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwEBE">↑</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-2" class="mw-reference-text reference-text"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106" about="#mwt17" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwEBI" data-mw='{"name":"templatestyles","attrs":{"src":"Module:Citation/CS1/styles.css"},"body":{"extsrc":""},"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"cite book","href":"./Template:Cite_book"},"params":{"last":{"wt":"Hall"},"first":{"wt":"Kermit L."},"title":{"wt":"The Oxford Companion to the Supreme Court of the United States"},"publisher":{"wt":"Oxford University Press"},"year":{"wt":"2005"},"isbn":{"wt":"978-0195176612"},"editor-last":{"wt":"Hall"},"editor-first":{"wt":"Kermit L."},"page":{"wt":"548"},"chapter":{"wt":"Judiciary Act of 1869"},"editor2-last":{"wt":"Ely"},"editor2-first":{"wt":"James W."},"editor3-last":{"wt":"Grossman"},"editor3-first":{"wt":"Joel B."},"chapter-url":{"wt":"https://books.google.com/books?id=cY3er3ilgjcC&amp;pg=PA548"}},"i":0}}]}'/><cite id="CITEREFHall2005" class="citation book cs1" about="#mwt17">Hall, Kermit L. (2005). <a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://books.google.com/books?id=cY3er3ilgjcC&amp;pg=PA548" class="external text" id="mwEBM">"Judiciary Act of 1869"</a>. In Hall, Kermit L.; Ely, James W.; Grossman, Joel B. (eds.). <i id="mwEBQ">The Oxford Companion to the Supreme Court of the United States</i>. Oxford University Press. p.<span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwEBU"> </span>548. <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/ISBN_(identifier)" title="ISBN (identifier)" class="mw-redirect" id="mwEBY">ISBN</a><span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwEBc"> </span><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Special:BookSources/978-0195176612" title="Special:BookSources/978-0195176612" id="mwEBg"><bdi id="mwEBk">978-0195176612</bdi></a>.</cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Abook&amp;rft.genre=bookitem&amp;rft.atitle=Judiciary+Act+of+1869&amp;rft.btitle=The+Oxford+Companion+to+the+Supreme+Court+of+the+United+States&amp;rft.pages=548&amp;rft.pub=Oxford+University+Press&amp;rft.date=2005&amp;rft.isbn=978-0195176612&amp;rft.aulast=Hall&amp;rft.aufirst=Kermit+L.&amp;rft_id=https%3A%2F%2Fbooks.google.com%2Fbooks%3Fid%3DcY3er3ilgjcC%26pg%3DPA548&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3AList+of+justices+of+the+Supreme+Court+of+the+United+States" class="Z3988" about="#mwt17" id="mwEBo"></span></span></li>
<li about="#cite_note-3" id="cite_note-3" data-mw-footnote-number="3"><span class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwEBs"><a href="#cite_ref-3" rel="mw:referencedBy" id="mwEBw"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwEB0">↑</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-3" class="mw-reference-text reference-text"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106" about="#mwt20" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwEB4" data-mw='{"name":"templatestyles","attrs":{"src":"Module:Citation/CS1/styles.css"},"body":{"extsrc":""},"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"cite web","href":"./Template:Cite_web"},"params":{"last1":{"wt":"McMillion"},"first1":{"wt":"Barry J."},"last2":{"wt":"Rutkus"},"first2":{"wt":"Denis Steven"},"date":{"wt":"July 6, 2018"},"title":{"wt":"Supreme Court Nominations, 1789 to 2017: Actions by the Senate, the Judiciary Committee, and the President"},"url":{"wt":"https://fas.org/sgp/crs/misc/RL33225.pdf"},"publisher":{"wt":"Congressional Research Service"},"location":{"wt":"Washington, D.C."},"access-date":{"wt":"October 4, 2018"},"archive-date":{"wt":"September 19, 2019"},"archive-url":{"wt":"https://web.archive.org/web/20190919022101/https://fas.org/sgp/crs/misc/RL33225.pdf"},"url-status":{"wt":"live"}},"i":0}}]}'/><cite id="CITEREFMcMillionRutkus2018" class="citation web cs1" about="#mwt20">McMillion, Barry J.; Rutkus, Denis Steven (July 6, 2018). <a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://fas.org/sgp/crs/misc/RL33225.pdf" class="external text" id="mwEB8">"Supreme Court Nominations, 1789 to 2017: Actions by the Senate, the Judiciary Committee, and the President"</a> <span class="cs1-format" id="mwECA">(PDF)</span>. Washington, D.C.: Congressional Research Service. <a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://web.archive.org/web/20190919022101/https://fas.org/sgp/crs/misc/RL33225.pdf" class="external text" id="mwECE">Archived</a> <span class="cs1-format" id="mwECI">(PDF)</span> from the original on September 19, 2019<span class="reference-accessdate" id="mwECM">. Retrieved <span class="nowrap" id="mwECQ">October 4,</span> 2018</span>.</cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Abook&amp;rft.genre=unknown&amp;rft.btitle=Supreme+Court+Nominations%2C+1789+to+2017%3A+Actions+by+the+Senate%2C+the+Judiciary+Committee%2C+and+the+President&amp;rft.place=Washington%2C+D.C.&amp;rft.pub=Congressional+Research+Service&amp;rft.date=2018-07-06&amp;rft.aulast=McMillion&amp;rft.aufirst=Barry+J.&amp;rft.au=Rutkus%2C+Denis+Steven&amp;rft_id=https%3A%2F%2Ffas.org%2Fsgp%2Fcrs%2Fmisc%2FRL33225.pdf&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3AList+of+justices+of+the+Supreme+Court+of+the+United+States" class="Z3988" about="#mwt20" id="mwECU"></span></span></li>
